<http://data.silknow.org/object/1bb3f872-f034-3b91-9a3a-525b86e07000>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Panel, rounded at lower end, made of 1 1/4 widths of cotton (no selvedges remain).  Cherry-red copperplate print on white ground.  Nine vignettes; family in horsecart, riders on causeway approaching town gate, fiddler and bagpipe-player, hurdy-gurdy with drummer and dancers, pedlar with mule, goats and cow resting, town harbor with classical ruin, Commedia dell'Arte players on platform stage, women roasting meat on a spit.  A few brown and pink stains (run of dyes?); cotton in good condition, two small holes."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/0a458600-1c6a-3497-b6db-ebb167dc0c70> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/5c65b403-98a6-3a58-be31-0586a2846ed1> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/4ada1110-f8e9-3e86-81e0-21ff3fb87537> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Panel, rounded at lower end, made of 1 1/4 widths of cotton (no selvedges remain).  Cherry-red copperplate print on white ground.  Nine vignettes; family in horsecart, riders on causeway approaching town gate, fiddler and bagpipe-player, hurdy-gurdy with drummer and dancers, pedlar with mule, goats and cow resting, town harbor with classical ruin, Commedia dell'Arte players on platform stage, women roasting meat on a spit.  A few brown and pink stains (run of dyes?); cotton in good condition, two small holes."@en ;
        dc:identifier                  "50.2471" ;
